le":"","content":"Sadly know, Full at the moment. <br /> <br /> Does anyone playing have an issue with using discord or a preference for a different client?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T18:20:27-07:00","id":1299804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JiveX</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1293856-anyone-interested-in-a-terrestrial-game?p=1299772#post1299772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sadly know, Full at the moment. <br /> <br /> Does anyone playing have an issue with using discord or a preference for a different client?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm more than fine with discord.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T19:46:23-07:00","id":1299822,"title":"","content":"With its ability to simultaneously run multiple channels for everything from the game itself to ooc chats and side conversations or scenes, I actually prefer Discord above anything else.","si