A12WHxv9IxDm7HL6t9J3w/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Most of my backstory can be sussed out by taking a look at my Intimacies, I have more then a few of them.<br /> <br /> I'm currently filling out the details, but other than that, I'm ready to go.<br /> <br /> As a note to my fellow players, if anyone else is playing a student of the Spiral Academy, and if you are interested in possible character ties, please let me know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-12T09:34:57-07:00","id":1304449,"title":"","content":"Hey guys! Sorry I\u2019ve been MIA the last two weeks, I\u2019ve been traveling for work and my cousin just had her first child earlier this week so things have been hectic. I haven\u2019t had time to prep for tonight so I\u2019d like to set an official start date for next Friday. Appologies for the incovenience, I\u2019ll be responding to the backlog of messages tomorrow afternoon. Again so sorry all, been a very hectic and exciting couple weeks IRL.<br /> <br /> Thanks for your patience. I promise to deliver an exciting and reliable play experience for everyone going forward","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2116-jivex","name":"JiveX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2116_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"267"}]},"thankedby